#36750
"Edge of A Mountain Path"
"You are at the end of the trail around the mountain.  Peering over the
northern edge of the trail, you can marvel at the wide expanse of mountain
tops.  Strong gusts of wind from that direction make it difficult for most
anyone to keep from falling over.  A few pebbles occasionally skid past your
feet before tumbling over the eastern border of the trail, beginning their
near infinite descent down the rocky terrain.  Looking closer at the ground
past the dust swirls, you can make out numerous hooven footprints.
"
"Blow horn to get pegasus to transport to Cirrus Titus
This acode is temporary until Severus codes force_mount/force_dismount so that
a pegasus will arrive and players to ride it and control their flight upwards.
[Olah] Somehow people can be summoned into this room mounted causing problems
"
