pick up in intensity here.  Several twigs lay scattered along the dusty
ground.  One or two of them occasionally gyrate with each passing breeze.  To
the west is a rocky slope whose apex is indiscernible from this location.  The
trail elevates upward to the north and declines slightly to the south.
