forty feet tall.  The hand shape near the top is in a holding position, as
though it were carrying the clouds above it.  Numerous dirt marks from its
midway point down to its base have been left on it.  However, the obsidian
remains remarkably well preserved with no other signs of disturbance or
erosion.
"
