#36882
"Inside A Tendriculos's Body"
"Green, slimy fluids flow along the bottom of the inside of the tendriculos's
mass.  The lingering smell from the fluids makes it almost impossible to
breathe.  Adding to the overwhelming stench are the decayed remains of some
poor creatures who were the tendriculos's previous victims.  There is an
