#36892
"A Spacious Cave"
"A tremendous warmth can be felt throughout this enormous cavern.  In addition,
the pungent smell of chlorine and sulfur pervades, making it uncomfortable to
breathe in here.  Hanging from the ceiling high above is a multitude of
stalactites that taper off into sharp-looking tips.  Charred rocks and ashen
soot litter much of the ground and walls.  The rocks and soot are mixed within
a massive pile of useless, rusted coins that rise a few feet above the ground.
"
""
