"This large branch twists and tangles into the air away from the tree.  It is
slick and glossy with a black, sooty film, as is much of the tree.  Small
purple flowers grow from the soot near the ends of the branches, adding some
unusual color to the blackened scene.  Any attempt to jump down would probably
result in a great deal of pain, leaving your only means back to the ground at
the trunk of the tree to the south.
