"Inside A Cavernous Passage"
"A line of stalactites that resembles the teeth of a dragon hangs high above. 
Beside the stalactites along the cavern ceiling, crystalline rock formations
can barely be detected as they are partially imbedded within obsidian-colored
dust and stone.  Accumulated in boulder-like layers to the east are midnight
black carbonate and brown-red, volcanic rock.
"
