"Inside A Cavernous Passage"
"A shaft that would fit a few large creatures dominates the ground here. 
Gravel pieces and soot have been haphazardly spread around the borders of the
shaft.  Hanging from the ceiling is a stalactite that points directly down
toward the center of the shaft.  A dank current of air seems to emanate from
below, although it is too dark and deep to determine whether anything exists
there from this vantage point.
"
